            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-5 md:gap-6 lg:gap-7 mt-6 sm:mt-8 md:mt-10">

            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-black/5" style="background-color:#FAF9F4;">
                <img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/dJKpVzDX/Adaptive-Learning.png" alt="Adaptive Learning" class="w-full h-36 sm:h-40 md:h-44 object-cover" />
                <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6">
                    <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#1F3B2C]">Adaptive Learning</h3>
                    <p class="mt-1.5 sm:mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-5 sm:leading-6" style="color:#6B7568;">
                        Questions adjust to your skill level — harder when you excel, easier when you struggle
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-black/5" style="background-color:#FAF9F4;">
                <img src="https://i.ibb.co.com/S40QJtbp/AI-Tutor.webp" alt="AI Tutor" class="w-full h-36 sm:h-40 md:h-44 object-cover" />
